[0001] empty uid with rollback time => InvalidArgument (not ClockRollback)
[0002] missing pod at rolled-back time => ClockRollback (not PodNotFound)
[0003] missing pod => PodNotFound (not phase/conflict/allowance)
[0004] terminal pod matching 2 budgets => NotEvictablePhase (before Conflict)
[0005] evicting pod that newly matches 2 budgets => AlreadyEvicting (before Conflict)
